{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:35:56.985553+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist", "proposal_text": "We respect that and believe a strong in-house team is the best foundation.\n\nOur clients are in the same position. They use our service not to replace their talent, but to augment it. With top-tier analysts, does your team ever find their bandwidth constrained, causing a backlog of diligence on secondary or tertiary opportunities?\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity to help clear those backlogs. This allows your primary team to stay focused on top-priority targets while ensuring broader market coverage.\n\nWould you be open to a brief call to discuss how our overflow support could complement your team's workflow?"}
