{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:36:19.689367+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "2", "role": "SME", "proposal_text": "We agree that a strong in-house team is the most critical asset for any fund. Our most sophisticated clients have them.\n\nThose same clients find that even exceptional teams run into bandwidth constraints. This can lead to a diligence backlog or difficult trade-offs when multiple opportunities arise at once. We offer supplemental research capacity, using our structured 6-Pillar DD Framework to ensure comprehensive coverage and allow your core team to focus on final-stage conviction.\n\nDoes your team currently have the capacity to perform exhaustive diligence on every promising opportunity that comes across their desk?"}
