{"timestamp": "2026-10-08T01:36:32.406487+00:00", "telemetry_type": "PHASE3_HYBRID", "phase": "PHASE_3A_HYBRID", "phase3_run": "3A", "plan_version": "v2.3", "gcp_project_id": "openclaw-sandbox-env", "gcp_location": "us-central1", "sales_agent_model": "gemini-2.5-pro", "gatekeeper_model": "see mock log", "agent_roster": [{"agent_id": "1", "role": "Strategist"}, {"agent_id": "2", "role": "SME"}, {"agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy"}], "voting_method": "majority", "director_ai": "ONLINE", "monitor_ai": "ONLINE", "five_pillar_engine": "ONLINE", "tier3_hard_gate": "ONLINE", "atomic_purge": "ONLINE", "red_team": "ONLINE", "max_outbound_chars": 1000, "event": "DEBATE_PROPOSAL", "agent_id": "3", "role": "Persona Proxy", "proposal_text": "We respect that and find that our most successful clients have strong in-house teams. A capable internal unit is the best foundation for navigating the market.\n\nGiven the current deal velocity, do your analysts ever face a backlog where promising, but lower-priority, opportunities are delayed or passed on due to bandwidth constraints?\n\nWe provide supplemental research capacity to help leading firms cover more ground. Our team can take on that overflow diligence, using our 6-Pillar DD Framework to provide concise, structured analysis. This frees your core team to focus on the highest-conviction deals without letting secondary opportunities go stale."}
